{
  "file" : "npc/other/gympass.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Hey, there. People aren't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "as physically active as they"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "used to be. Even if you fight"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "for a living, your body might"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "be weak and flabby in some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "areas. Know what I mean?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Hey, train with me, and I can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "guarantee that you'll be able"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "to lift and carry more of your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "stuff. Just gimme your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "^FF0000Gym Pass^000000 each time,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "and we'll be good to go."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "But don't get too excited:"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "no matter how much training"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "I take you through, you can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "overdo it. You ever hear of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "anyone that got too buff?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "That's cuz they're dead. See?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "I'd say that it'd be safe"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "for you to seriously train"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "with me and increase your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "item carrying capacity ^FF000010 times^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "So... Are you ready to sweat?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Yes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "No"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Um, my workouts wore off."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Oh, awesome, I see you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "brought your Gym Pass."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Alright, just do what I do,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "and try to feel the burn."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Ready? Let's do this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "There, you should be able"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "to carry more stuff with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Let's see, we can increase"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "your item carrying capacity"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@remain_carry"
      ],
      "text" : "^FF00000{0}^000000 more times if we continue"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "training together like this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Dude, what'd I tell you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "You gotta bring me your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "^FF0000Gym Pass^000000 if you wanna"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "work out, and build up your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "item carrying muscles."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Dude, I don't think we can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "build up your item carrying"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "muscles anymore than that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "It's too dangerous for your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "body if we even tried! C'mon,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "I told you about the limits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Aw, that's too bad."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Well, come back if you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "change your mind. Tell"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "your friends about me:"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "if they're flabby, I'll help"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "get them in shape."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "You let your item carrying"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "muscles just atrophy? Lucky"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "for you, there's such a thing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "as muscle memory. It's won't take"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "as long to build 'em back up..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "How about that?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Your item carrying"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "muscles grew back,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "just like that! Try not to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "wimp out again, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "[Ripped]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "Uhh..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "We didn't work out"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "together before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Ripped Cabus",
      "text" : "I'm sure about that."
    }
  ]
